---
layout: base.njk
title: 项目归档
permalink: /archive/
---

<h1 style="font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 20px;">📚 全部项目归档</h1>

{% set grouped = collections.projects | groupByDate %}
{% for day in grouped %}
<div class="archives-year">
  <h2>📅 {{ day.date }}（{{ day.items.length }} 个）</h2>
  <ul>
    {% for item in day.items %}
    <li>
      <span class="d">{{ item.data.title }}</span>
      <a href="{{ item.url }}">查看拆解 →</a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
</div>
{% endfor %}

<p style="color: var(--muted); margin-top: 30px;">没有更多了。每天新增的项目会出现在这里。</p>
